# Memory Index

<!--
This file loads into context at the start of every session, so it holds INDEX
LINES, never content. One line per memory: a link and a hook. The detail lives
in the file the line points to, loaded only when a session needs it. When this
index grows past its ceiling, move the oldest lines to MEMORY-archive.md — never
delete, only move. A curation routine owns that trim. See docs/04.

The lines below are sanitized examples showing the shape, one per type.
-->

